   zoom-figU1-4-ur.png, zoom-figU1-6-ur.png). No tofu, no fallback-font mixing in body prose.
2. RTL layout: pages are dir="rtl"; headings, lists, checklists and the print handout flow
   right-to-left correctly. The translation-status badge renders in Urdu ("مسودہ" = draft,
   crops/ur-badge.png).
3. Bidi: Western numerals inside RTL prose order correctly (18,400/16,000 in topic-01 CYU-2;
   47 ضرب 52 = 2,500 in MCQ-6; 63/80 in MCQ-3; 348/2/10 in RRQ-5 - crops:
   t01-checkunderstanding-summary.png, zoom-ua-mcq-options.png, zoom-ua-rrq-numbers.png).
   Embedded Latin (MCQ markers a)-d), Bloom's tags, the untranslated words "tutors" and
   "brain storming") renders left-to-right inside the RTL line without reordering damage
   (crop: zoom-t02-activity-tutors.png).
4. Figure mirroring (style-guide v4.1): all six .ur.svg variants reflect x-coordinates about
   the viewBox centre and swap text anchors; table column order reads correctly right-to-left
